31,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well. Now that the first night has passed, the Seer may have gained some insight. @Jonathan, @Misaki, @May, @Sakura, does anyone wish to share their thoughts?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Misaki"",""May"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I'm still in the observation phase. Since the Seer's result is the most critical piece of information we have now, I'll wait to see if anyone is willing to come forward or if any contradictions arise in our discussion.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,May,,"I'm getting a bit impatient! @Jonathan, you were so focused on ""revelations"" last night. Did you find one? Or is the Seer playing hard to get? Come on, give us a little hint!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I have indeed found a revelation, May. It is a heavy burden to carry, but for the safety of the village, I must be honest. I am the Seer, and my divination reveals that Sakura is the werewolf.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""May"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Whaaa?! @Jonathan, that's a big fat lie! I'm not a werewolf! I'm just a little girl! Why would you say that? You're the meanie! I'm super shocked right now! Teehee... wait, I can't teehee! This is serious!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"This is a startling revelation, Jonathan. If your words are true, the path forward is clear. However, we must consider if this is a bold move by the werewolf to frame a child. @Sakura, how do you respond to this?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Sakura, your reaction is quite emotional, which could be genuine or a performance. @Jonathan, claiming the Seer role so early is a risk. If you are lying, you've put a target on your back. Why choose to reveal yourself now?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,May,,"@Jonathan, that was a bold move! I love the drama, but @Misaki is right. Why the rush? Are you really that confident, or are you just trying to end the game quickly before we spot your ""mask of normalcy""?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I reveal myself now because the truth is absolute. To hesitate when the werewolf has been identified would be a betrayal of my duty to the village. I prefer clarity over games, and Sakura is the threat.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Jonathan is a big meanie! I'm not a threat, I'm just Sakura! Everyone, please don't believe him! He's just making things up to look like a hero! I'm just a regular human, I promise!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a difficult position to be in. @Jonathan, your conviction is strong, but @Sakura's distress is palpable. If we execute an innocent child, we lose a valuable member of our community. Is there any doubt in your divination?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Servas, while I sympathize with Sakura, we must prioritize the logic of the game. If Jonathan is the Seer, his result is factual. If he is the werewolf, he is bluffing. The risk of leaving a werewolf alive is higher than the risk of a mistake.","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Sakura"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm starting to lean toward Jonathan. It's a high-risk play, and usually, the werewolf tries to blend in rather than pointing fingers so aggressively on day one. @Sakura, your ""meanie"" act is cute, but is it a cover?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"There is no doubt in my divination, Servas. The vision was clear. While Sakura's distress may seem genuine, the werewolf often hides behind the most innocent masks. I ask you all to trust the evidence over emotion.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'm not wearing a mask! I'm just me! @May, how can you believe him? I've been so nice to everyone! @Jonathan is just trying to trick you all because he's the real bad guy! Please, please don't vote for me!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""May"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It is a heavy decision, but we must act for the greater good. Jonathan's resolve is unwavering, and as Misaki noted, the risk of leaving a werewolf among us is too great. I shall trust the Seer's vision. I vote for Sakura.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Misaki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with Servas. While it is unfortunate, we cannot ignore a direct claim from the Seer. If Jonathan is lying, he will be the next logical target, but for now, the evidence points to Sakura. I vote for Sakura.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Jonathan"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,May,,"I'm usually all for the drama, but this is just too clear-cut. Sorry, Sakura, but your cuteness isn't enough to override a Seer's claim. I'm going with the evidence. I vote for Sakura.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I have spoken my truth and provided the evidence. For the safety of our village and to ensure our survival, I must cast my vote for the one I have seen. I vote for Sakura.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Noooo! This is so unfair! I can't believe you're all listening to that meanie! I'm just a little girl! I'm not a werewolf, I promise! Please, someone help me! I vote for @Jonathan!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
